heory/crosswake/compare/hex-v0.2.11...hex-v0.2.12) (2026-11-07)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **195-19:** classify structural credential identifiers ([37f450f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/37f450f6ca4249e8882e921dcbbf1bbaab55ca7b))\n* **195-20:** mask reviewed provider cli url and jwt boundaries ([8c519bf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8c519bfff50ef46eb62c58ae140eb68f9b6130b7))\n* **195-20:** prove bounded raw windows and independent rule timings ([c7a0fed](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c7a0fed6e25ddbe930cde955bd8b76c51758c1ae))\n* **195-20:** require supported stdout mask registration ([7ee7f99](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7ee7f99474ceb8a212cc998f57f529e2ae9bb9ed))\n* **196-01:** capture exact guard blobs on main with verified restoration ([6b549da](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/6b549da0180e4aa1ab40fde1aa1de208a07952ff))\n* **196-01:** verify preserved planning and actual-main execution source ([8b61333](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8b613331f6b81419e1e4eb928355d5a20692e1ff))\n* **196-02:** fail closed on requested generated evidence ([67a46f5](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/67a46f59b0d0a3bf4391e2f909e7dcf5e6db04c1))\n* **196-02:** require real Plug proof when explicitly enabled ([d6f5528](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d6f552877523fb2710b94128caff8c70f3e28558))\n* **196-03:** pin Elixir vector executions and prove input-loss failures ([d07543e](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d07543e16f5bbf9dcc521d198a7bac51ceed6222))\n* **196-03:** pin Swift vector executions with rebuilt resource controls ([b2dc413](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b2dc413269e3f94dee2a02dcdfa36122ae912ed3))\n* **196-04:** enforce metadata reader corpus availability ([d4a74cf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d4a74cfc7804844bef275333314141dc9e9d2e12))\n* **196-04:** pin topology selection and inventory real readers ([75da76f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/75da76f2afd5153e63db1519b50be26544ca2613))\n* **196-04:** prove both Swift reply corpus cases ([28bb00b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/28bb00b8a08d6d62ecc5e5dcbab6314ac86e89e3))\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin reply and metadata readers without vacuous evidence ([77c74b4](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/77c74b4b1a3ecbe21c26ce232b33e5cc65e5112a))\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin request populations through clean Gradle builds ([38bef11](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/38bef11c6b948470201ec58fb5703682e4dcbb08))\n* **196-06:** analyze collection assertions in report mode ([ed93089](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/ed93089387973173cec02e679bc7e7ba9e6e5529))\n* **196-09:** measure native Mix thresholds with exact compilation coverage ([7d122ba](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7d122baf4c2ea598c62bea8537173133e2a801e7))\n* **196-10:** record two exact arbitrary extension containments ([dc67ffc](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/dc67ffcb77ce645de05e421897cde9feac8c218f))\n* **196-10:** return closed advisory location results ([984d1ef](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/984d1ef3dd786a5d02f7d2245af770fb41ce6c10))\n* **196-10:** scan six rescue families with exact semantic exceptions ([7fa1197](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7fa11971ffc4bdcc0b5c1566d495a82f55553cd2))\n* **196-11:** evaluate reviewed runtime dependencies in isolated Mix contexts ([fcf747a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/fcf747a38c0e16e60f596dffcf8dd5ee841a1bec))\n* **196-12:** classify conserved credential statements before scalar filtering ([9bd6ef1](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/9bd6ef175ff220d7129ba5d2c28d501eee59a885))\n* **196-12:** execute bounded grammar families and conserve denied statements ([8b88fbf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8b88fbf59d7002585a54799482e47806b45ece7c))\n* **196-13:** capture useful pinned no-tce bootstrap ([4a816d7](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4a816d7477aff500d2482942654e982043009dbf))\n* **196-13:** validate real reports and five kill-survive controls ([c5de913](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c5de913f53f766fb1a8182fab2d8f085aabd1424))\n* **196-14:** enforce pending outcomes and fixed mutation appetite ([560050c](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/560050c668f6b409d3503305b5c2f46d433e5fb1))\n* **196-14:** run full frozen baseline with terminal restoration ([e187bcc](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e187bcc681696d713af7495def1cb6db6db0cf3d))\n* **196-15:** add phase-evidence disposition mode and SPEC-04 claim scan ([4dbf90d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4dbf90d36c15eef6a678a56d8147e62b4d0c5158))\n* **196-15:** add promotion, candidate, gate and landed modes to phase-evidence ([37a783f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/37a783f98a9af2b5c5e82b14d155ecbbdbbc1e75))\n* **196-15:** count the native and core suites directly and require a fresh producer manifest ([d97297b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d97297b89004a476ce4d47b0ab98909bf88c7336))\n* **196-15:** default the absence collections mode to enforce ([206ee4b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/206ee4b2f45b390fddffff2bfae4cd8145ca3336))\n* **196-15:** force Gradle execution, pin native counts and extend the review ([6fa356a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/6fa356a62c03edb82b7598bbfbb9bb1679c8f5a4))\n* **196-15:** pin observed executed and excluded counts per candidate child ([9f72c79](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/9f72c791bb95c6b7621224e3d25a62bc5e0c8e01))\n* **196-15:** read ExUnit counters independently and add subset observation ([962e40e](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/962e40e62a36e16dba4e2016cf31daab1198f65e))\n* **196-15:** verify reviewed 15/16/17 replan identity in verify-source ([c08163a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c08163a676f4fd19ebda7a42f302458d7cff9dd6))\n* **197-01:** add relative link and anchor counter to docs-report ([9066d0a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/9066d0ab498dd91ff6b07294fa5a2c4739eb5a1d))\n* **197-01:** add report-only docs-report with leak counter ([71f51d9](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/71f51d94464ab66eb726d1c7b59ef38439f156cc))\n* **197-02:** add mix docs warnings counter and not-in-CI guard to docs-report ([3b8ff2f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/3b8ff2f77fcef87ee0b92aaeb53c6fb66ecefd68))\n* **197-04:** add docs leg with commit-pinned sources and run-block executor ([4b46613](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4b466137860af43019f45346760b9f6a5ef4682b))\n* **197-04:** bound every documented step and host-generation command in time ([76eba5d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/76eba5d885d270a7750467c734a6879d16ae7dff))\n* **197-05:** default the docs leg to the Hex tarball of the version under test ([01bbade](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/01bbade3986492c2e1fd278bec4d53a9c3a535f9))\n* **197-06:** apply deps through the substitution table and compile the host before the doctor ([d649304](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d6493045d65ff70efeeb0139f30e5efe2f2ac9df))\n* **197-06:** the five remaining apply modes, each with idempotence and anchor controls ([b11bd05](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b11bd0547b94a0fc19043f8979e943861adb1756))\n* **197-07:** since=/NOT_APPLICABLE and the per-file required-step check in the docs leg ([55a5ba2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/55a5ba28dbf342bd927aa5540fe6db134ca7e2af))\n* **197-07:** version-conditional ios_host deferral and the executed floor in the docs leg ([e15a883](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e15a883e0fef338fecba9443abd7ffd7e22143d6))\n* **198-01:** extract listener boundary and harden SemVer to digit-only components ([8cb0dff](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8cb0dff7e879d92198c87b9ed3d8811559a63f77))\n* **198-06:** typed Android evidence ceiling and per-row Android evidence column ([bf1ff18](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/bf1ff1816823bd6c6e0fea43222daddaaa9ce930))\n* **198-07:** consumer registry, per-vector table and negative controls for the ledger ([09d0f76](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/09d0f7683dad6e21c5c01b3dfa9ac2de4c26438b))\n* **198-07:** generated parity ledger with raw-bytes vector-set hash ([7f47b55](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7f47b55d8d2487ee7f768786fd255d3fa6ea4369))\n* **198-09:** foreign-host proof against the published Maven coordinate with a wrong-coordinate control ([1b8ea8f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/1b8ea8f5c0e3d0af25370c80d5b6e7bcc5bc2787))\n* **198-10:** derive foreign-host promotion readiness from CI history and evidence artifacts ([a12110d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/a12110d293ada7187769d6938567d530d1c0885c))\n* **198-10:** show derived foreign-host promotion readiness in the bearings report ([39a0cb3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/39a0cb353681a2c6ed378c3f36318c1511cb1f4f))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n* **199-01:** add post-publish iOS mirror tag equality check ([3c18977](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/3c1897738290b7daab4606f8458389117b0240f7))\n* **199-03:** add credential-free release environment preflight ([bf222af](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/bf222afc4bba512e088141bb3f2b253097d48fe7))\n* **199-06:** attest companion receipts for any companion package ([c17f3e3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c17f3e35fe0eb92a7e2c56336a9afca800b8a306))\n* **199-06:** render and check companion release trailers ([3c128b4](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/3c128b49c2389b61a6622b6135c3272deb690736))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **194-09:** classify script/bearings-report as a scannable