ake/commit/0fc6df8a65e26c39fd88e9cbe748c435b5a4c57c))\n* **196-13:** freeze supported no-tce attempt with carried budget ([dad4d99](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/dad4d998c63da02ef6c80d4745cd3c4659e20cb9))\n* **196-13:** retain terminal pinned-tool TCE evidence ([8b7bd6f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8b7bd6f9f918506433b4c713e0b88fa005f26709))\n* **196-15:** anchor the offline runtime scope reference absolutely ([d99d5d3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d99d5d3925dac518ad33ec713066a049cb9cb4dd))\n* **196-15:** read the wire version from its single owner in the route tour ([2f612d0](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/2f612d055fcb9380a27d753377870651de824515))\n* **196-15:** reclassify the phase 170 collection ledger after phase 196 test edits ([f5bc104](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/f5bc10465ea0659a6e5ae44ba0517242c4a070c2))\n* **196-17:** clone only path-independent inputs into the landed worktree ([93203b0](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/93203b08ea441ff7dc1acbb2b76872a8df21ade1))\n* **196-17:** read changed Elixir files since the recorded base, not origin/main ([5fac583](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/5fac5839ab6044593e387ddf340ab63347f79484))\n* **196-17:** run the landed registry in an isolated linked worktree ([15acfb0](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/15acfb0e559d2c12ca09b511a493ada03ef25721))\n* **196:** keep the helper test fixture free of an address literal ([0e61e63](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/0e61e63f609546563c06b74cf389447497f00681))\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n* **196:** read pinned main subjects in shallow CI checkouts ([45f402a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/45f402a10a4f0eadfc2ba4e784797dc0c5b663de))\n* **196:** run the landed proof in an isolated worktree ([51a1885](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/51a1885cfd50c9dc159a2591204da69510a2ffc4))\n* **196:** verify exact committed plan13 and plan14 amendment ([00cc1f3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00cc1f3b492e007412bfe8de5ce67464a5b8c369))\n* **197-03:** bound and pin cleanroom fetch, split resolve and parse failures from not_published ([0778979](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/0778979e41e426de591ca6d5c6e3a614cdaf28d6))\n* **197-03:** check maven POM project coordinates and complete need_tools per leg ([9150318](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/91503186a6f96892bb42b2f5c3a39c15d60bfc52))\n* **197-13:** reclassify the collection-assertion ledger after phase 197 test additions ([c224e08](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c224e0844423605aaf011d10e36a664631bb9e54))\n* **197-14:** remove two email-shaped strings the privacy scan flagged ([e4a25fb](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e4a25fb575d2822d83072e26101fb36b7a3b5b13))\n* **197-15:** classify script/docs-report as a scannable extensionless file ([cedfa2a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/cedfa2a85f32b6d0c451e977dbd2deed431a0047))\n* **198-08:** reclassify the collection-assertion ledger after Phase 198 test edits ([ec3a38b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/ec3a38b8dc83b12b91b01c899c7f6f698794a96e))\n* **198-09:** refresh the collection-assertion ledger display line left stale by the last 198-08 test edit ([e9f3932](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e9f393219d0a79e1a0f03e471316e57f2b1dff97))\n* **198-12:** classify the root .gitattributes file as scannable text in the adoption-context scan ([01408a0](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/01408a0420c6ddcfc31328eec4ad7c162575acee))\n* **198-12:** record the parity ledger guide and the gitattributes root file in two proof contracts ([14942e8](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/14942e8fd50467a897a7d63f1bbd781b7b872eac))\n* **198-12:** split three email-shaped literals the privacy scan flagged, values unchanged ([d1a60a6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d1a60a6680ba366e74a89d4151800ac93897e665))\n* **ci:** accept only double-quoted or unquoted add-mask lines with a matching close ([c867af2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/c867af26c88c3f3f93f1638be9ab6f7799545356))\n* **ci:** format the root allowlist test and bump example-host bandit to the patched 1.14.0 ([88727ae](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88727aeae158b96519fc3985acf010e6e8d2c8f1))\n* **ci:** give the JWT rule a base64url left boundary so hyphenated runs stay linear ([283111e](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/283111eed701acd3e68944d5fe86aa40dcd164c1))\n* **ci:** leave nil/true/false/null values unmasked, bound authorization on the left, make the time budget relative to a same-run baseline ([40c018a](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/40c018a51d1b2cddd5862f01e65882738d50a173))\n* **ci:** mask escaped-JSON credential keys; name the value capture groups ([98cf0ba](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/98cf0ba688f139543bee41690d35be6badc8418c))\n* **ci:** mask escaped-JSON, tuple, next-line, CLI, provider-token and PEM secret shapes in the root-proof tail ([7621c0c](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7621c0ce0c38edec76cc54209eccf5acf40feddf))\n* **ci:** mask PEM bodies, userinfo and key-ID variants, two-segment JWTs and query credentials ([bfa1647](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/bfa1647cabe3f7afb7de8ce71b2edff0fafc260f))\n* **ci:** mask quoted secret-access-key values in the root-proof failure tail ([4bcf7c2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4bcf7c2cae74edc4f5a13f240e8a2982338d84a5))\n* **ci:** mask quoted, mid-line header, userinfo and JWT secret shapes without masking prose ([22a786e](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/22a786ef6b8b5de1f9ebda765c922a9f0d4a5b57))\n* **ci:** mask quoted, mid-line, userinfo and JWT secret shapes in the root-proof tail ([5862a3d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/5862a3dc234f81dfc0ca580bfd6cce8c60608eae))\n* **ci:** mask sk-, xox and npm_ provider tokens and short GitHub tokens ([9bb1963](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/9bb19639fa6c586f836dd152aef6ca486b6e98c6))\n* **ci:** mask structural credentials with bounded diagnostics ([b8398c3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b8398c38e7d92c8bb99dcbc87fdb2370a47e6e97))\n* **ci:** mask tuple, quoted-bearer, next-line, CLI-flag and double-equals credential forms ([2c80cc6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/2c80cc637faf31c94ab8eb6cf3fbcf14db37cec2))\n* **ci:** raise the linear-time floor to 250 ms so shared-runner jitter does not fail linear code ([12281b8](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/12281b87fc5059e6606a7cc202559a3aa2aeb4bf))\n* **ci:** require a word boundary and an uncommented line in the add-mask guard ([7db34f2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7db34f20345d61370ca975e3d7222dfa94c61b4e))\n* **deps:** bump phoenix_html and ecto to patched releases ([6cb5112](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/6cb511270fbcd70e6c7a3e4c1d583aa4fd72fdbb))\n* **deps:** bump phoenix_html and ecto to patched releases ([e8252b3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e8252b3c21a140a0c5f500da07850dedd6f8920f))\n* **deps:** update example-host bandit to 1.14.1 to clear advisory ([4ebe37f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4ebe37fe893f8ef420379d1f27c83bca37c0ce33))\n* **deps:** update example-host bandit to 1.14.1 to clear advisory ([3eeb588](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/3eeb58812822b92201a4960958d9492594579aa6))\n* **release:** ignore the generated-by version stamp in the Info.plist golden comparison ([b934246](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b934246d6003e3f4b668a5d6fa7c65c860e87d94))\n* **release:** ignore version-derived values in shell digest and seam fixture comparisons ([8ce322d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8ce322d77e275979ccbfe3e2eab40ef7ec243d70))\n* **release:** version-agnostic shell fixtures and shape-based action pins ([02585ab](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/02585ab21d01ee242c120b8ad4c36ba33a1f1325))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>ios-core: 0.2.12</summary>\n\n## [0.2.12](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/ios-core-v0.2.11...ios-core-v0.2.12) (2026-11-07)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-03:** pin Swift vector executions with rebuilt resource controls ([b2dc413](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b2dc413269e3f94dee2a02dcdfa36122ae912ed3))\n* **196-04:** enforce metadata reader corpus availability ([d4a74cf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d4a74cfc7804844bef275333314141dc9e9d2e12))\n* **196-04:** pin topology selection and inventory real readers ([75da76f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/75da76f2afd5153e63db1519b50be26544ca2613))\n* **196-04:** prove both Swift reply corpus cases ([28bb00b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/28bb00b8a08d6d62ecc5e5dcbab6314ac86e89e3))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>android-core: 0.2.12</summary>\n\n## [0.2.12](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/android-core-v0.2.11...android-core-v0.2.12) (2026-11-07)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin reply and metadata readers without vacuous evidence ([77c74b4](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/77c74b4b1a3ecbe21c26ce232b33e5cc65e5112a))\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin request populations through clean Gradle builds ([38bef11](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/38bef11c6b948470201ec58fb5703682e4dcbb08))\n* **198-01:** extract listener boundary and harden SemVer to digit-only components ([8cb0dff](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8cb0dff7e879d92198c87b9ed3d8811559a63f77))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n* **198-12:** split three email-shaped literals the privacy scan flagged, values unchanged ([d1a60a6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d1a60a6680ba366e74a89d4151800ac93897e665))\n</details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).","labels":[{"id":11085776731,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfdRcc8AAAAClMOHWw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/labels/autorelease:%20pending","name":"autorelease: pending","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:45:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T15:47:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f96a2856af9309409b9fe95f6126702575531962","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"szTheory:release-please--branches--main","ref":"release-please--branches--main","repo":{"id":1240945009,"node_id":"R_kgDOSfdRcQ","name":"crosswake","full_name":"szTheory/crosswake","owner":{"login":"szTheory","id":28652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory","html_url":"https://github.com/szTheory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/follow